WEBVTT

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.375
Disgaea

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.671
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:20.742
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:28.460
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:33.692
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:42.238
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:48.474
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:54.645
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:01:01.353
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:07.865
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.198
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.702
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:22.342
I'll give you my love.

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:42.028
Do you have the slightest idea
who I am?

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:46.104
Why are you
attacking me?

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:11.826
Gosh, attacked by three monsters at once!
You're really Mr. Popular, aren't ya?

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.125
You sly dog!

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.957
This is getting on
my nerves.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:19.534
Still, I wonder why you're being attacked
again and again like this?

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:20.537
I have no idea.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:25.076
Well, this means that news of your return
is spreading all across the Netherworld.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:28.280
This saves you the trouble of getting the
news out yourself, wouldn't you say?

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:37.723
Oh, my! Look over there,
Highness!

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.317
Is that a UFO?

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:49.065
"Bounty of 1 million HL to be paid to
the demon who kills Overlord Laharl."

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:50.266
What's this?

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.770
Wow, there's a price on
your head, Highness! No way!

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.402
A million?

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.804
Amazing!
That's my Prince!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.074
THAT'S all they think
my life is worth?!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:08.753
So those smalltime demons were really
bounty hunters? I'm shocked! Shocked, I say!

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:13.020
What I want to know is, what fool out there
had the gall to put a price on my head?!

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.619
Can you think of any
likely demons?

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:19.756
If I had to guess, I'd say it was the people
in Celestia who sent Flonne here.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.665
In any case,
this is intolerable!

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.068
Once I get my hands on him,
he'll wish he'd never been born!

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.902
Now that you mention it, Highness,
where IS Flonne?

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.033
I don't care!

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:37.772
The Dungeon of Temptation!
Maybe, Maybe Not...

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:46.388
Laharl! Etna!

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:52.487
How could they abandon a vassal
in a place like this?

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:58.095
It's so mean!

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:02.901
But this might be a trial
that I have to overcome...

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:07.302
Yes, that must be it!
This is more of Laharl's tough love!

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.506
I'll tough it out!

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:16.488
What did you say? There's a bounty
on the Prince's head?

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:20.020
YES. THAT IS WHAT IS WRITTEN
ON THAT FLYER.

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:24.595
If we got that bounty, we'd have enough
to pay for repairs on our spaceship!

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:27.527
This means that our luck
has finally turned around!

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:32.901
That's right, Jennifer! As Defender of Earth,
I will bring him down no matter what!

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:34.965
That should do it,
Thursday.

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:41.903
I've installed dowsing mods that
will let you search for the prince.

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.709
This will let us track
him down in no time!

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:47.816
Amazing! We can always
count on you, Jennifer!

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.512
All right, show us your stuff,
Thursday!

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:51.656
SCAN IN PROGRESS.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.726
BEEP BEEP BLIP BEEP.

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:57.929
SIGNATURE DETECTED
IN THIS DIRECTION.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:04:59.765
NOW COMMENCING PURSUIT.

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:01.356
Okay, let's get going!

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:04.436
Just you wait,
you notorious demon!

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:10.266
There's something pleasantly gloomy and
creepy about this forest, isn't there?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.841
What's the matter,
Highness?

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:20.007
Take a look at that rock.
We passed it a while ago.

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:21.518
Now that you mention it...

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:27.082
Are you telling me that we're going
around in circles?! This isn't good!

00:05:27.193 --> 00:05:28.785
You only realized it
just now?

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:33.559
And there's nobody around to ask
for directions... We're in a real bind here.

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.127
I'm hungry.

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:40.103
So am I.
I'm starving.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:42.637
Quit your complaining
and call in the Prinnies!

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:45.710
Right! Prinny Squad,
assemble!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.673
Prinnies, I've got a job
for you!

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:54.711
What's the problem?

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:57.915
It doesn't look like they're coming.
I wonder if they're busy with something else?

00:05:59.425 --> 00:06:01.791
And you people call yourselves
vassals of the great Overlord?!

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:03.896
Remember, the Prinnies
are MY vassals!

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:06.590
Like I said before, YOUR vassals
are by definition...

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.633
I'm done counting on
you people.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:18.035
Hey! Wait, Highness!

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:26.484
Now it's raining!

00:06:32.558 --> 00:06:34.617
Uh, this strikes me
as a wee bit suspicious.

00:06:34.727 --> 00:06:36.718
Don't look a gift horse
in the mouth.

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:55.777
Overlord Laharl is here!
Is anyone home?!

00:07:02.155 --> 00:07:04.089
I welcometh thee, Overlord!

00:07:09.629 --> 00:07:11.893
You should have been here to greet me
as soon as I came in the door!

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:14.900
Please forgiveth my rudeness.

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:16.932
Excuse me, the Prince
and I are both...

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.728
Dinner is waiting for you.
Right this way.

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:25.802
Really? But we didn't even
say that we were hungry...

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:28.244
Why complain?
She isn't wasting our time.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.514
Wow, this is all
for us?!

00:07:34.086 --> 00:07:36.577
I only hopeth that it's to
the Overlord's liking.

00:07:39.826 --> 00:07:41.953
I have to say, though, finding
a fancy spread like this...

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:45.326
...in the middle of a forest goes way
beyond suspicious, don't you think, High...

00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:48.594
You're already eating!

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:50.794
It tastes fine.
You eat, too.

00:07:51.204 --> 00:07:56.164
I swear, you're the easiest man in the
Netherworld to poison, Highness...

00:07:59.512 --> 00:08:00.945
This is great!

00:08:16.028 --> 00:08:17.461
TARGET DETECTED.

00:08:17.563 --> 00:08:19.827
We've found you,
prince of the Netherworld!

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:21.832
You won't get away
this time!

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:34.074
Hey, something went over
our heads just now...

00:08:36.249 --> 00:08:39.150
You won't escape us this time,
my good demon prince!

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:43.049
You lunatics again?! I'm in the middle
of dinner! Come back later!

00:08:43.155 --> 00:08:45.680
Uh, Highness, I think you should
take a look at this.

00:08:52.999 --> 00:08:56.162
The Overlord is my prey!
You will not layeth a finger on him!

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:57.596
He's your what?!

00:08:57.703 --> 00:09:00.501
What did I tell you?
I KNEW this was fishy.

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:03.939
First I'm your guest and now I'm
your prey, huh? Who are you?

00:09:04.744 --> 00:09:07.304
I have awaited your arrival,
Prince Laharl.

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.840
My name is Saldia
the Demonslayer.

00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:12.214
Demonslayer?

00:09:13.452 --> 00:09:16.853
My blade hath taken the lives
of over 2000 demons!

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.318
That many, huh?

00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:20.653
Or was it UNDER 2000?

00:09:21.193 --> 00:09:22.455
Which is it?!

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:27.629
With but a single swing of this sword,
even the land itself is cleft in twain!

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.596
Really? It splits
in half?

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:31.930
Maybe, maybe not.

00:09:32.171 --> 00:09:33.661
Which is it?!

00:09:33.773 --> 00:09:38.233
In any event, the life of Overlord Laharl
is in mine to do with as I pleaseth.

00:09:39.946 --> 00:09:44.315
Now I get it. It looks like this is the perfect
time for a little after-dinner exercise.

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.315
Thursday!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:54.949
Whew!

00:09:56.562 --> 00:09:58.359
Let the wailing and gnashing
of teeth commenceth!

00:09:58.464 --> 00:10:00.227
For down below is the far reaches
of the Netherworld!

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.096
It's the what?!

00:10:03.836 --> 00:10:04.996
Maybe, maybe not.

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:07.197
MAKE UP YOUR MIND, DAMMIT!

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.643
I am in the habit of taking my time
and savoring my meals.

00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:17.905
We did it! At long last, he's been sealed
away in the depths of the earth!

00:10:18.184 --> 00:10:19.845
Thank you for
your assistance!

00:10:20.386 --> 00:10:22.616
We'll split the bounty
with you fifty-fifty, and...

00:10:25.358 --> 00:10:27.417
I'M SLIPPING!

00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:36.796
As if I would ever alloweth my bounty
to be stolen by a mere human!

00:10:43.609 --> 00:10:47.807
Where am I?
Which way should I go?

00:10:48.147 --> 00:10:51.708
O great Seraph,
please show me the way!

00:10:55.788 --> 00:10:59.451
Laharl! Etna!

00:11:09.368 --> 00:11:11.495
So, that demon was after
the bounty on me, too?

00:11:11.604 --> 00:11:15.131
Probably. Or maybe she just drops
people into pits for kicks.

00:11:16.709 --> 00:11:18.233
Must be a magical barrier.

00:11:19.278 --> 00:11:20.745
Try it again, Highness.

00:11:25.384 --> 00:11:27.409
See? Now we have
plenty of light.

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:30.151
Don't treat my mighty magic
as a stand-in for a box of matches!

00:11:30.256 --> 00:11:33.589
Now, where's that exit?
I kinda doubt there IS one.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:37.393
I swear, that dead-man-walking
who put that bounty on me...

00:11:37.496 --> 00:11:39.123
...is causing me nothing
but trouble!

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.597
I'm gonna find out who
it was, mark my words!

00:11:50.076 --> 00:11:53.603
Like I said, we can't use magic
in here because of... That's hot!

00:11:56.649 --> 00:11:58.913
Highness, the place
is on fire!

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:00.177
Put it out!

00:12:01.754 --> 00:12:03.915
Damn it, step aside!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.358
Highness, you're just
making the fire worse!

00:12:14.834 --> 00:12:15.732
What's that?

00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:19.827
Oh, the pit is equipped with a fire
extinguisher system! What a relief!

00:12:25.678 --> 00:12:28.010
Hey, we don't need
any more water!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.613
Ah, she's using
water torture.

00:12:30.349 --> 00:12:32.317
You're kidding!

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:39.253
Something's in here
with us!

00:12:46.031 --> 00:12:47.794
Disgaea

00:12:49.001 --> 00:12:54.940
Disgaea

00:13:01.514 --> 00:13:03.175
I can't fight properly,
floating around like this!

00:13:03.516 --> 00:13:05.381
Highness! Highness!

00:13:05.851 --> 00:13:07.876
Look at that!

00:13:10.022 --> 00:13:13.890
Ah, what a fine view. I shall taketh
the liberty of enjoying this little show.

00:13:14.293 --> 00:13:16.659
Oh, so I'm an hors d'oeuvre
for your wine, am I?!

00:13:18.597 --> 00:13:20.758
More to the point, what the heck
kind of fish is that thing?!

00:13:22.268 --> 00:13:26.136
Mizuchi! A monster whose
favorite food is lively demons!

00:13:29.108 --> 00:13:30.939
Oh, you don't say...

00:13:31.043 --> 00:13:32.305
Or so I'm told.

00:13:32.745 --> 00:13:34.406
What, you don't know?!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.812
So, a Demonslayer keeps a demon-slayer
as a pet, huh? Interesting hobby you have...

00:13:40.186 --> 00:13:44.088
Go forth, Mizuchi! Giveth those two
a slow, painful death!

00:13:52.464 --> 00:13:54.227
Where is the Prince?!

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:55.990
I CAN'T BE SURE...

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:01.106
It looks like there's a powerful
barrier down here.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.668
Don't give up!

00:14:02.775 --> 00:14:07.075
There is no obstacle that the 37th
Defender of Earth can't overcome!

00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:09.508
Boost your gain
and keep trying.

00:14:09.615 --> 00:14:10.582
ROGER.

00:14:17.223 --> 00:14:18.349
Highness!

00:14:20.259 --> 00:14:22.921
Yes, I want them
to suffereth!

00:14:49.121 --> 00:14:51.248
That's it!
Now, let's try that again!

00:14:53.792 --> 00:14:55.123
What in the...

00:14:57.496 --> 00:15:00.932
DANGER! DANGER! MASSIVE VOLUME
OF WATER APPROACHING!

00:15:01.166 --> 00:15:02.326
A what?!

00:15:02.434 --> 00:15:04.299
DANGER! DANGER!

00:15:08.674 --> 00:15:13.304
Jennifer! Thursday!

00:15:19.485 --> 00:15:21.817
That lady's really put me
through the wringer...

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:24.151
You've got some nerve,
Demonslayer!

00:15:33.132 --> 00:15:35.032
I can't walk another step...

00:15:35.367 --> 00:15:38.632
Laharl...
Seraph Lamington...

00:15:48.113 --> 00:15:50.138
Who are you?

00:16:05.064 --> 00:16:09.023
You want me to help you?
Help you do what?

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:11.264
You needn't hideth
the truth from me.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:14.203
You are aftereth the Overlord's life,
too, are you not?

00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:18.436
Like I said, I'm Laharl's vassal,
and I'm trying to find him.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:19.770
Silence!

00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:23.947
If that is how you wanteth it, I might be
persuaded to giveth you part of the bounty.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.151
Bounty? Bounty on what?

00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:31.979
Still trying to playeth dumb
with me, are you?!

00:16:36.962 --> 00:16:39.624
It's not only the bounty
on his head that I am after.

00:16:40.599 --> 00:16:44.000
The amount of money and valuables that Laharl
stands to inherit from the previous Overlord...

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:47.397
...is so vast that it would
fill up that lake!

00:16:47.539 --> 00:16:49.598
Gosh, really?

00:16:50.142 --> 00:16:52.007
Or maybe it wouldn't.

00:16:52.911 --> 00:16:57.041
Why do demons think about
nothing but money?

00:16:57.383 --> 00:17:00.079
Surely there are things that are
more important than money!

00:17:00.486 --> 00:17:02.420
I do not expecteth your people
to understand.

00:17:03.055 --> 00:17:05.958
The neverending fixation on
and ambition towards money...

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:07.755
The grandeur of it!
The beauty of it!

00:17:07.893 --> 00:17:10.225
In any case,
I can't help you!

00:17:10.562 --> 00:17:11.688
If you insisteth!

00:17:13.265 --> 00:17:15.631
You leave me no choice
but to eliminate you.

00:17:16.969 --> 00:17:18.266
One!

00:17:19.038 --> 00:17:20.027
What?

00:17:21.907 --> 00:17:24.671
Here in the Netherworld,
fighting dirty is a virtue!

00:17:26.145 --> 00:17:27.942
Two!

00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:32.149
The praises of insincerity
are sung, as well!

00:17:34.853 --> 00:17:39.119
Three! Strike down this irritating fly
that's buzzing around my ears...

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:40.953
...my Overlord's Wrath!

00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:49.163
Overlord Laharl
stands before you!

00:17:50.436 --> 00:17:52.495
Laharl, that was
so cool!

00:17:52.704 --> 00:17:54.729
Use that as your entrance speech
from now on!

00:17:55.174 --> 00:17:57.699
I'm glad to see that
you're okay, too, Etna!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.005
You're also a lot more tenacious
than I gave you credit for.

00:18:00.179 --> 00:18:03.512
Saldia, you have some nerve,
challenging the Overlord!

00:18:03.615 --> 00:18:07.551
You will be the 2001st demon that this sword
has dispatched as swiftly as the morning fog!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.451
- Maybe, maybe not.
- Maybe, maybe not.

00:18:09.588 --> 00:18:13.183
Don't stealeth my catch-phrase!
Prepare to meet your maker!

00:18:14.326 --> 00:18:15.258
Beauty!

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:18.251
Who's there?!

00:18:18.864 --> 00:18:23.233
Such an angry expression will ruin
your exquisite face, Mademoiselle.

00:18:23.802 --> 00:18:26.100
Just great, somebody else
is butting in...

00:18:26.505 --> 00:18:28.905
What did you come here for,
you measly Mid-Boss?

00:18:29.241 --> 00:18:30.868
I am no Mid-Boss!

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:35.906
I am an aristocrat who is in search
of love and beauty, the Dark Adonis!

00:18:36.315 --> 00:18:41.014
My lovely Mademoiselle, Overlord Laharl
is my eternal rival.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.815
I ask that you be so good
as to stand aside.

00:18:42.921 --> 00:18:46.186
Since when am I your "eternal rival"?
Keep out of this!

00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:49.527
Well, it looks like another person has
arrived to try to claimeth the bounty.

00:18:49.895 --> 00:18:52.830
A bounty, you say!
Perish the thought!

00:18:52.931 --> 00:18:57.800
Do I strike you as a vulgar demon who
could be tempted by mere filthy lucre?

00:18:58.036 --> 00:18:59.731
Not to me,
Mr. Mid-Boss!

00:18:59.838 --> 00:19:04.537
Merci, Mademoiselle! But how many times
must I tell you that I am not a Mid-Boss!

00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:06.873
I am the Dark Adonis, who seeks
out love and beauty...

00:19:06.979 --> 00:19:08.241
Oh, shut up!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.027
Your bark is worse
than your bite.

00:19:30.736 --> 00:19:31.828
Say your prayers.

00:19:33.605 --> 00:19:35.664
Wait, Laharl!

00:19:36.708 --> 00:19:37.675
Unhand me!

00:19:37.776 --> 00:19:41.337
Finishing someone off without giving them
the chance to repent is going too far!

00:19:41.446 --> 00:19:45.348
I'm sure that demons are capable of repenting
for their sins, just like angels are!

00:19:45.684 --> 00:19:47.174
We do not!

00:19:47.319 --> 00:19:51.756
No, I'm sure that deep down, there is love
in your heart that is capable of...

00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:54.458
...feeling mercy and forgiving
the sins of others!

00:19:56.028 --> 00:19:57.427
More of your
love nonsense?!

00:19:57.529 --> 00:19:59.019
I have faith in you,
Laharl!

00:19:59.364 --> 00:20:03.698
In the mercy and genuine love that
have begun to blossom in your...

00:20:04.169 --> 00:20:05.033
Huh?

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.834
Oh, brother. Here's another one
who never learns her lesson...

00:20:31.029 --> 00:20:32.656
What's the matter,
Highness?!

00:20:32.764 --> 00:20:36.222
Don't tell me that what Flonne
said just now got to you!

00:20:37.202 --> 00:20:38.829
Of course not,
don't be stupid.

00:20:40.172 --> 00:20:42.367
Saldia. You're going to take me
to see the person...

00:20:42.507 --> 00:20:44.702
...who told you that there was
a bounty on my head.

00:20:45.711 --> 00:20:47.542
I'm going to claim
the bounty myself!

00:20:48.347 --> 00:20:52.807
Um, Highness, I don't think I need to
remind you that the bounty is ON you...

00:20:53.051 --> 00:20:57.715
Exactly. If I go and turn myself in, that
means I get to take credit for my capture!

00:20:58.056 --> 00:21:00.217
What about it? You have
a problem with my plan?

00:21:00.425 --> 00:21:03.360
Um... No, sir, none at all.

00:21:03.862 --> 00:21:08.697
Attaboy! You're Krichevskoy's son, all right!
You've got your finger in all kinds of evil pies!

00:21:09.167 --> 00:21:10.964
Don't go overboard
with the compliments.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:15.898
My sword!

00:21:16.141 --> 00:21:18.336
From this day forward,
you're my vassal.

00:21:18.543 --> 00:21:21.034
You won't be needing a
demonslayer's sword anymore.

00:21:21.146 --> 00:21:22.010
Let's go!

00:21:24.049 --> 00:21:28.383
So... this means that I have
a vassal now, too, doesn't it?

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.317
Yay! I'm so happy!

00:21:30.789 --> 00:21:31.847
Don't get the
wrong idea.

00:21:32.157 --> 00:21:34.591
You're always gonna be the lowest
vassal on the totem pole!

00:21:35.494 --> 00:21:37.325
Aw, you're kidding!

00:21:37.663 --> 00:21:40.154
Saldia, you're going
to be our guide.

00:21:43.001 --> 00:21:48.871
But the one who first mentioned the bounty
to her was... Oh, what the heck!

00:21:49.608 --> 00:21:55.240
Wait for me! I had a horrible time finding
my way out of that desert you left me in!

00:21:55.347 --> 00:21:57.008
Oops, sorry about that!
We didn't notice that you were gone!

00:21:57.115 --> 00:21:58.673
I doubt that!

00:21:59.985 --> 00:22:02.783
The Defender of Earth
is back in action!

00:22:03.989 --> 00:22:07.755
I stand before you!
Where is the demon prince?!

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:12.619
Um, hello? The Mid-Boss
is up here, everyone!

00:22:13.298 --> 00:22:15.459
Oops, I called myself
the "Mid-Boss"...

00:22:18.904 --> 00:22:21.873
Overlord Laharl, one day
I will slay you!

00:22:22.207 --> 00:22:24.004
Maybe, maybe not...

00:22:41.059 --> 00:22:48.488
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:48.834 --> 00:22:56.570
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:56.875 --> 00:23:04.714
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:04.816 --> 00:23:11.779
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:20.228
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:20.332 --> 00:23:28.000
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:35.444
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:36.148 --> 00:23:39.879
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:39.985 --> 00:23:43.978
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:49.190
Chain react...

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:59.066
Etna, the in-your-face babe reporter
is on the scene!

00:23:59.171 --> 00:24:01.503
Today's target is Flonne,
the top Evil Idol!

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:05.503
I hear your public and private personas are like
night and day! I'm gonna expose the real you!

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.976
That's so mean! What makes
you say that I'm evil?!

00:24:08.079 --> 00:24:11.378
When you've got no evidence, make it up!
Feast your eyes on this scandalous photo!

00:24:11.483 --> 00:24:13.678
Gosh, this fake nude picture
is really well done!

00:24:13.785 --> 00:24:18.245
Next time on Disgaea!
"Etna's Embarrassing Secret"!

00:24:18.356 --> 00:24:20.025
So, tell us!
What's your secret, Etna?

00:24:20.025 --> 00:24:20.826
Next Time:
Etna's Embarrassing Secret
So, tell us!
What's your secret, Etna?

00:24:20.826 --> 00:24:22.828
Next Time:
Etna's Embarrassing Secret
Don't ask me that, okay?

00:24:22.828 --> 00:24:24.887
